Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Build the required schedules, methodology notes, and narrative with consistent quantities and boundaries. Present gaps and restatements clearly, obtain responsible review, and preserve the exact submitted edition and subsequent corrections.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
